---
import { SITE_TITLE, SOCIAL_LINKS } from '../consts';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title={`About · ${SITE_TITLE}`}
	description="Serhii Soldatov, software engineer. I like solving problems I don't know how to solve yet."
>
	<header class="sr-article-head">
		<h1 class="sr-display">
			Hi, I'm <em>Serhii</em>
		</h1>
		<hr class="sr-seam" />
	</header>
	<div class="sr-prose">
		<p>I like solving problems I don't know how to solve yet.</p>
		<p>
			That's probably my favorite part of engineering: learning something new, figuring things out, and eventually
			turning a difficult idea into something real. I work best with good people, enough freedom to make decisions, and
			a problem worth solving.
		</p>
		<p>This blog is where I write some of those problems down, once I've figured them out.</p>
		<p>
			The road isn't always straightforward.
			<br />
			But then, neither was the road to Mordor.
		</p>
		<p>
			Elsewhere:{' '}
			{SOCIAL_LINKS.map(({ label, href }, i) => (
				<>
					{i > 0 && ' · '}
					<a href={href} rel="me">
						{label}
					</a>
				</>
			))}
		</p>
	</div>
</Layout>
